OL,3,AUS envoys arrive in Moscow for Ukraine
OL,4,Atalks with Vladimir Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS envoys Jared Kushner and Steve
OL,7,FWitkoff have arrived in Moscow for
OL,8,Ftalks with Russian President Vladimir
OL,9,FPutin, a day after the latest talks
OL,10,Faimed at ending the war in Ukraine
OL,11,Fwrapped up in Abu Dhabi.
OL,13,FVideos shared by Russian media showed
OL,14,FKushner and Witkoff disembarking a
OL,15,Fplane and being welcomed by Kremlin
OL,16,Fenvoy Kirill Dmitriev with handshakes
OL,17,Fand hugs.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
