OL,3,AUS envoys arrive in Moscow for Ukraine
OL,4,Atalks with Vladimir Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe American negotiatiors were due to
OL,7,Fmeet Putin at 12:00 local time (09:00
OL,8,FGMT), and will then fly to Dublin to
OL,9,Fspeak to Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky.
OL,12,FOn Tuesday, Kushner said the US had
OL,13,Fseen "some openings and some
OL,14,Fopportunities" and that they would try
OL,15,Fto "make some progress" at the meeting
OL,16,Fwith Putin.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
